tpm2-kira (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of tpm2-kira
  * TPM2-based TOTP authenticator with PCR policies
  * Support for sealing and unsealing TOTP secrets
  * Integration with initramfs for early boot authentication
  * Support for multiple PCR selections
  * Fallback password authentication
  * Commands: seal, reseal, reveal, info, nvram, version

 -- Matthias R. Wiora <matthias@wiora.io>  Thu, 01 Jan 2024 12:00:00 +0000

tpm2-kira (0.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial package structure
  * Basic functionality implemented

